flowchart LR
    P[(Primary)] -->|redo| S[(Standby)]
    S -->|RMAN incremental + archive logs| L[(Local backup disk<br>7 days)]
    L -->|copy| OS[(Object storage<br>immutable, 35 days + yearly)]
    P -->|flashback logs, undo| F[Flashback<br>hours to days]
    S -->|weekly Data Pump| DP[(Schema exports)]
    K[Keystore backup] --> OS2[(Separate secure location)]
    OS --> RT[Quarterly restore test<br>scratch environment]
